                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding: 4px 20px 16px;">
                    <p style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6b6b6b; margin: 0;">Tracking often shows nothing for the first 2–4 days – the parcel is on its way to the flight, not lost. You don't need to do anything, it updates as soon as the parcel is checked in.</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
